  "new_v0_9_claims": [
    "exact affine DFT transition: output frequency eta is the sum of precisely the input frequencies xi with m*xi=eta; translation contributes only the standard additive-character phase",
    "bounded affine polynomial substitution satisfies the exact Hasse coefficient law coeff_q(p(aX+b)) = hasseDeriv_q(p)(b)*a^q",
    "a nonzero output Fourier/jet coordinate under a positive affine section has a nonzero source coordinate whose frequency maps to the output and whose jet order is at least the output jet order",
    "multiplication of a frequency moves its divisor-shell index only upward under divisibility",
    "the explicit closure generated by divisor-upward shell movement and downward jet movement is positive-affine section invariant",
    "pure Fourier/monomial atoms prove divisor-upward shell closure is necessary for every invariant shell/jet mask",
    "translation by one of a pure Fourier/monomial atom proves jet-downward closure is necessary over the complex coefficients used by the certified profile theory",
    "InvariantShellJetSet equals ExplicitShellJetClosure of ActiveShellJetSet for every profile submodule H in the declared finite complex bounded-profile category",
    "InvariantShellJetEnvelope is exactly the shell/jet mask cut out by that explicit closure and has exact finrank equal to the number of retained Fourier-frequency/jet coordinates"
  ],
  "explicit_boundaries": [
    "the v0.9 classification is a theorem about the minimal positive-affine-invariant shell/jet zero-mask envelope, not an assertion that this envelope equals the generally smaller absolute ProfileOrbitHull",
    "ActiveShellJetSet is mathematically explicit but no finite black-box algorithm for recovering it from an arbitrary supplied submodule is proved in v0.9",
    "jet-downward necessity is proved over the complex coefficient field; the proof uses nonvanishing binomial coefficients and is not exported unchanged to positive characteristic",
    "nonunit affine multipliers can alias several input Fourier frequencies into one output frequency; the theorem retains the exact sum and does not replace it by a permutation formula",
    "Bell generalized Cobham theorem remains external and is not formalized",
    "Bell Theorem 1.5 remains used only in its checked integer-valued two-multiplicatively-independent-base regular scope",
    "root-of-unity rational generating-function to eventual quasi-polynomial normalization remains external",
    "the naive base-independent integral normal form remains false and rejected",
    "no arbitrary-ring, semiring, infinite-dimensional, or unrestricted-category classification is claimed",
    "Lean verification does not establish literature novelty, publication priority, or independent peer review"
  ],
